    "description": "Bendos Action Figure Lot - 5 Figures and Accessories\nKid Galaxy, Vintage 1999-2000\n3 Sealed In Tubes, 2 Loose\nThis collection features five bendable figures from Kid Galaxy's popular Bendos line, which dominated the poseable toy market in the late 1990s and early 2000s. Known for their distinct minimalist face designs and wire-core flexibility, Bendos are sought after for their unique aesthetic. This lot includes three factory-sealed figures in original cylindrical packaging and two loose figures with character-specific accessories.\nFigures Included:\nMega-Parachute Bendo - Sealed in large tube #604, includes red parachute.\nSanta Bendo - Sealed in tube #270, includes green toy sack accessory.\nDiamond Softball Player - Sealed in tube #103, includes baseball bat.\nScuba Diver and Tech Figure - Loose figures with \"Kid Galaxy\" markings.\nAccessories: Diving helmet, daisy acoustic guitar, two money bags, and snowboard.\nCondition:\nThree figures are factory sealed in original plastic tubes; tubes show light shelf wear and minor scuffing. Loose figures show minor paint rubs consistent with light use but retain full poseability. All included accessories are in good vintage condition with vibrant colors and no structural damage.",
